OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to replace former bank with
OL,4,Acare home refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to knock down a former bank in
OL,7,FLoughborough and build an 80-bed care
OL,8,Fhome have been turned down.
OL,10,FCharnwood Borough Council has refused a
OL,11,Fplanning application from Synergy Care
OL,12,FDevelopments to redevelop the site of
OL,13,Fthe former Barclays bank in Bishop
OL,14,FMeadow Road.
OL,16,FThe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,17,F(LDRS) said the banking chain moved out
OL,18,Fof the site in 2020 and planning
OL,19,Fdocuments state there had been "little
OL,20,Fto no serious interest in the
OL,21,Fproperty".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
