OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to replace former bank with
OL,4,Acare home refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a council report said the proposed
OL,7,Fscheme was in "close proximity" to a
OL,8,Fsite which had hazardous substances
OL,9,Fconsent and the authority found "the
OL,10,Fdevelopment would increase the number
OL,11,Fof people exposed to potential major
OL,12,Faccident hazards".
